+# Concrete next-wave boundaries
+
+New geometry authors consume an independently reviewed map/contract. Native critique checks map structure; it does not prove rendered geometry or approve runtime behavior. Existing accepted source repairs do not wait for these new proposals.
+
+Library owns ONE persistent selection/Describe/run-status/cancel group, with pagination separate. At1440x1000 and719x960 tall rows may scroll but must not hide the action/status or cover focused content. Preserve ReviewSurfaceContext primary ownership, resolveDescribeSubmitAction, focusable aria-disabled guards, tenant/run-id store and idempotency. No second run state/poller. Actual GPU, actual description job and recognition are separate observations; unknown GPU never means usableCPU/results. Review drafts requires completed items+valid runroute. Navigation resumes, never resubmits.
+
+Control pane owns recognition evidence and current selected group. Show one useful empty next step; collapse empty secondary reviews without hiding nonempty findings/errors. WB_CONTROL owns outer/control CSS; ACTION_PROGRESS owns inner MediaSelection CSS. These can be authored in parallel; joined gate verifies scroll interaction. No new live-state derivation.
+
+People reuses stable personID, existing listPersonMedia GET and Photos workspace.64px directory/96px header are testable design defaults, not canon mandates. Explicit View photos must not relabel cluster_count as imagecount: current field counts facegroups. This slice improves legibility/discovery, not wholesale curation. Real wrong-association correction is distinct from rename/merge/delete; reuse separately accepted IDENTITY mutation/receipt contracts, never cosmetic relabel/name deduplication.
+
+Usage is conditional on APP-1 owner agreement. ADR014 says WP site attempts != tenant balance. Existing PortalUsageResponse has tenant_id, nullable used/reserved/remaining/allowance, period_start/end, period, as_of,status,data_source, but get_portal_usage requires interactive require_portal_principal. This packet does NOT prove a WP API-key read endpoint. Do not rebuild portal.py or borrow Clerk identity. Qualify exact existing machine-read route or owner-reviewed additive read contract before source dispatch. API/UI then run in parallel against that frozen contract. Unknown stays unknown, with period/observation time; local cap separate; one Usage & billing home. Reserve len(uniqueMediaIDs) does not prove onecreditpersuccessfuldescription: started failed/cancelled may settle. No new pricing/topup/provider/admission state.
+
+ACTION_PROGRESS owns only MediaSelection.tsx/_media-selection.scss/scoped tests; original GPU_STATUS exclusively owns useGpuStateToasts/useActivityStatus/GpuControlCard/status vocabulary. Geometry consumes existing status read-only without a false precedence edge.
